[b]What's new:[/b]

• improvement of animation;
• bug fixes with assessment;
• some minor improvements.

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/42691369/8ce134653146917a0ef33f75697dd584a92b0ec2.png[/img]

[b]What's new:[/b]

• added a new course "Computer Graphics";
• fixed a critical problem in the course "Natural numbers";
• some minor improvements.

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/42691369/d1a0af1e9c0ccd9a647c8797605409914c7db67a.png[/img]

[b]What's new:[/b]

• corrected errors in the course "Natural numbers";
• corrected errors in the course "Table of Powers";
• some minor improvements.

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/42691369/0df48a98c6941a6fe612c0b8eea05ef116cb0eb0.png[/img]

[b]What's new:[/b]

• improvement and correction of errors in the "Technology" course;
• new course "Number e" (DLC — Constants);
• several translation errors have been corrected;
• a confirmation window for exiting the task appeared;
• some minor improvements.

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/42691369/b30dad7831cbcd719d16cfdf2023f1dad4e7ebcf.png[/img]

[b]What's new:[/b]

• improvement in exercises from the course "Mechanical movement";
• the navigation panel for stages and questions has been improved;
• some minor improvements.

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/42691369/7e6fcfdeccffa11f17bb515b2bed743020121f82.png[/img]

[h3]What's new:[/h3]

• new course "Time conversion";
• new course "Mechanical movement";
• new extension "1540*980";
• the contacts of the support service are indicated in the settings;
• partial optimization;
• several significant errors have been corrected;
• some minor improvements.

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/42691369/7117509bc6be5dd4878dfdfc3725c6ef17ca0f3e.png[/img]

[b]What's new:[/b]

• the "Factory" exercise from the "Technology" course has been improved;
• fixed several problems with the assessment in the "Aim trainer" course;
• a confirmation window was added when trying to exit the program;
• some minor improvements.

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/42691369/4a0a0c384d406118dad7fe0d5c00aef95769281c.png[/img]
